hint: Inside, first go left: `while node is not None:` push it and move to `node.left`.
hint: Then pop a node, append its value, and set `node = node.right`.
right: Each node waits on the stack until its left subtree is done, is visited when popped, and then hands over to its right subtree. Every node is pushed and popped once: O(n).
